<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the RUST game for the M92 Semi-Auto Pistol. If you set to LButton you can interrupt fire by tapping RButton. Use caution when shredding with this baby


In-game settings:
- FOV 90-Sensitivity 0.66/ I use .66 anywhere between .66-.7 is good

Command console F1 - «input.sensitivity 0.66» </Description>
    <Comment>Please Enjoy</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 37 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>